<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Berg Electronics started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Berg Electronics started.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrington Research said Friday it initiated  coverage of Berg Electronics Corp with a 2-buy rating for long-term  growth investors.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe that Berg's emphasis on new product development, cost  reduction and market share will continue the rapid earnings growth  through 1998,&quot; Barrington said in a report.</p>
<p>-- Berg Electronic shares dropped 3/4 to 39-3/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
